  "rawHtml": "<div style=\"font-family:'Noto Serif SC',serif;background:#fbfaf7;padding:6px 0;\">\n  <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #0a0a0a;padding-bottom:6px;margin-bottom:8px;\">\n    <span style=\"font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.16em;color:#6b6b65;\">Q.01</span>\n    <span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#0a0a0a;font-weight:600;\">订阅是否包含纸质刊？</span>\n  </div>\n  <p style=\"font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.85;color:#3a3a38;margin:0 0 14px;\">不含。本刊数字订阅与纸刊为独立产品，需分别购买。</p>\n  <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #0a0a0a;padding-bottom:6px;margin-bottom:8px;\">\n    <span style=\"font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.16em;color:#6b6b65;\">Q.02</span>\n    <span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#0a0a0a;font-weight:600;\">可否退订？</span>\n  </div>\n  <p style=\"font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.85;color:#3a3a38;margin:0;\">可以。订阅后三十日内全额退款，逾期按比例返还。</p>\n</div>"
